---
description:
  Edge metadata animate and animation make the edge's dashes move from source to target, as in
  v12. The thick edge A to B and the edge B to C run fast, C to D runs slow, and D to E is a
  plain edge that does not move.
---
flowchart LR
 A e1@==> B
 e1@{ animate: true }
 B e2@--> C
 e2@{ animation: fast }
 C e3@-.-> D
 e3@{ animation: slow }
 D --> E
